+++ b/features/clear-completed.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+Feature: Clear completed todos
+  As a person who has finished some todos
+  I want to remove all completed todos at once
+  So that my list shows only outstanding work
+
+  Background:
+    Given the todo app has the todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+
+  Scenario: The clear-completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: The clear-completed button is shown when at least one todo is completed
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is marked as complete
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
+
+  Scenario: Clicking clear-completed removes only the completed todos
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is marked as complete
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the todo list shows 1 todo
+    And the todo list shows the todo "Walk the dog"
+    And the todo list does not show the todo "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Clearing completed todos leaves the mark-all checkbox unchecked
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is marked as complete
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the todo "Walk the dog" is not marked as complete
+    And the mark-all checkbox is not checked
diff --git a/features/completing-todos.feature b/features/completing-todos.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..87fb16c
