+++ b/features/completing-todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+Feature: Completing todos
+  As a person managing my work
+  I want to mark todos complete and incomplete
+  So that I can track what is done
+
+  Background:
+    Given the todo app has the todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+
+  Rule: A single todo is toggled complete and incomplete
+
+  Scenario: Checking a todo's toggle marks it complete
+    When I check the toggle of the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is marked as complete
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" is not marked as complete
+
+  Scenario: Unchecking a completed todo marks it incomplete
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is marked as complete
+    When I uncheck the toggle of the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not marked as complete
+
+  Rule: The mark-all checkbox toggles every todo at once
+
+  Scenario: Checking the mark-all checkbox completes every todo
+    When I check the mark-all checkbox
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is marked as complete
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" is marked as complete
+    And the mark-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Unchecking the mark-all checkbox sets every todo incomplete
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is marked as complete
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" is marked as complete
+    When I uncheck the mark-all checkbox
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not marked as complete
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" is not marked as complete
+    And the mark-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: The mark-all checkbox reflects the aggregate state of the todos
+
+  Scenario: The mark-all checkbox is checked when every todo is complete
+    When I check the toggle of the todo "Buy milk"
+    And I check the toggle of the todo "Walk the dog"
+    Then the mark-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: The mark-all checkbox is unchecked when any todo is incomplete
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is marked as complete
+    Then the mark-all checkbox is not checked
diff --git a/features/counter.feature b/features/counter.feature
