@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+Feature: Active todo counter
+  As a person tracking my workload
+  I want to see how many active todos remain
+  So that I know what is left to do
+
+  Scenario Outline: The counter pluralizes the active item count
+    Given the todo app has <active> active todos and <completed> completed todos
+    Then the item counter reads "<phrase>"
+
+    Examples:
+      | active | completed | phrase       |
+      | 0      | 0         | 0 items left |
+      | 1      | 0         | 1 item left  |
+      | 2      | 0         | 2 items left |
+      | 0      | 1         | 0 items left |
+      | 1      | 1         | 1 item left  |
+      | 2      | 1         | 2 items left |
+
+  Scenario: The active count number is wrapped in a strong element
+    Given the todo app has 2 active todos and 0 completed todos
+    Then the item counter shows the number 2 wrapped in a strong element
