diff --git a/features/editing-todos.feature b/features/editing-todos.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2e9af75
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/editing-todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,54 @@
+Feature: Editing todos
+  As a person who changed my mind
+  I want to edit a todo's title in place
+  So that I can correct what needs to be done
+
+  Background:
+    Given the todo app has the todo "Buy milk"
+
+  Rule: Double-clicking the label starts editing
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking a todo's label opens editing mode
+    When I double-click the label of the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+    And the edit field of the todo "Buy milk" is focused
+    And the edit field of the todo "Buy milk" contains the text "Buy milk"
+
+  Rule: The edit is saved on Enter and on blur after trimming
+
+  Scenario: Pressing Enter saves the edited title
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+    When I enter "Buy oat milk" in the edit field of the todo "Buy milk"
+    And I press the Enter key in the edit field
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in editing mode
+    And the todo list shows the todo "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Scenario: Blurring the edit field saves the edited title
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+    When I enter "Buy oat milk" in the edit field of the todo "Buy milk"
+    And I blur the edit field of the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in editing mode
+    And the todo list shows the todo "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Scenario: Leading and trailing whitespace is trimmed from an edited title
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+    When I enter "  Buy oat milk  " in the edit field of the todo "Buy milk"
+    And I press the Enter key in the edit field
+    Then the todo list shows the todo "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Rule: Saving an empty edit destroys the todo
+
+  Scenario: Saving an empty edit destroys the todo
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+    When I enter "   " in the edit field of the todo "Buy milk"
+    And I press the Enter key in the edit field
+    Then the todo list shows 0 todos
+
+  Rule: Escape discards the edit and leaves editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Pressing Escape discards the edit and closes editing mode
+    Given the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+    When I enter "Buy oat milk" in the edit field of the todo "Buy milk"
+    And I press the Escape key in the edit field
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in editing mode
+    And the todo list shows the todo "Buy milk"
diff --git a/features/new-todo.feature b/features/new-todo.feature
new file mode 100644
