+++ b/features/visibility.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+Feature: Empty state visibility
+  As a person viewing my todo list
+  I want the main list and footer hidden when there are no todos
+  So that the interface stays clear of empty chrome
+
+  Scenario: The main section and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Given the todo app is freshly loaded with no todos
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer is hidden
+
+  Scenario: The main section and footer are shown when a todo exists
+    Given the todo app is freshly loaded with no todos
+    When I enter "Buy milk" in the new-todo input
+    And I press the Enter key in the new-todo input
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer is visible
+
+  Scenario: The main section and footer are hidden again after the last todo is destroyed
+    Given the todo app has the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the destroy button of the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer is hidden
